      "stage": 1,
      "text": "{\"sender\": \"liesbeth.vandenberghe@gaia2mail.com\", \"recipients\": [\"somsak.wongcharee@gaia2mail.com\"], \"subject\": \"FWD: Renewable Energy Options for Sustainable Architecture\", \"content\": \"> Dear Liesbeth,\\n\\nI hope this email finds you well. I came across your work on net-zero energy architecture and was impressed by your dedication to sustainable design. As a former journalist, I've always been fascinated by innovative solutions that can positively impact our environment.\\n\\nI'd like to share with you an article I wrote a few years ago on renewable energy options in the Middle East. I think you might find it relevant to your current project. The article highlights the potential of solar and wind energy in reducing carbon emissions and promoting sustainable development.\\n\\nI'd be happy to discuss this further with you and explore ways to integrate these options into your design. Please let me know if you're interested, and we can schedule a call at your convenience.\\n\\nBest regards,\\nKhalifa Al-Mansoori\", \"email_id\": \"67005f5df094b3ef5a22f36a14c9ad06\", \"parent_id\": \"74bd4c0171a5493ca38a66256c59bb11\", \"cc\": [], \"attachments\": {}, \"timestamp\": \"1728975603.0\", \"is_read\": \"True\"}",
